# A repeated diversion of the same key overwrites the earlier record.
MODULE: DiversionAckedOnlyWhenRecordedOverwrites
TARGET: DiversionAckedOnlyWhenRecorded
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a dead-letter record replaces the previous one for the key
PERTURBS: DeadLetter

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ dlq' = [dlq EXCEPT ![cur] = @ + 1]
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ dlq' = [dlq EXCEPT ![cur] = 1]
--- END